          "html": "Why choose a barrel sauna?",
          "text": "Why choose a barrel sauna?"
        },
        {
          "type": "paragraph",
          "html": "Barrel saunas are the most efficient shape to heat: there's less air volume above the benches, so they warm up fast. They're also one of the most affordable ways into a real outdoor cedar sauna.",
